  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Tom?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/69/Tom.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028162719\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Tom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tom\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Tom</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Tom</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-characters-29468\" title=\"Category:Characters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">non-player character</a> (NPC) who helps players find items. He is unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 14.\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i>Hi, I'm Tom and I can run errands for you. I'll wait by your roadside shop!</i> — Tom</p></blockquote>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Hiring Tom</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e8/Tom_Spot.png/revision/latest?cb=20180207150352\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Tom&amp;#39;s spot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tom&amp;#39;s spot\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Tom's spot</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Tom_Cost.png/revision/latest?cb=20160219154822\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Cost\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cost\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Cost</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Once Tom is unlocked at level 14, Players can hire Tom by tapping his spot. Once tapped, he works for free for three days (time is counted even if players do not buy anything from him).\n</p><p>After that period, his services can be purchased with <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. He charges 15 diamonds for one day, 60 for five days and 100 for ten days.\n</p><p>Tom can also be hired for free using a red <a href=\"/wiki/booster-28721\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Booster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">booster</a>.\n</p><p>Tom reminds you that he is available for work every day at 12:00 AM UTC.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying items</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/ef/Tom_Info.png/revision/latest?cb=20180817064706\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tom Info\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"94\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>Tom can find any item the player has unlocked except <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">building supplies</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/expansion-23339\" title=\"Expansion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">expansion supplies</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f6/Tom_interface.png/revision/latest?cb=20150110123812\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Items found by Tom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Items found by Tom\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"95\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Items found by Tom</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Tom always looks for the cheapest price and offers three options:\n</p>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd>✦1 to 3 of the item</dd>\n<dd>✦4 to 6 of the item</dd>\n<dd>✦7 to 9 of the item</dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<div></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/d5/Tom_Sleeping.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028162726\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Tom sleeping\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tom sleeping\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Tom sleeping</figcaption></figure>\n<p>If the player accepts any of the offers, Tom fetches the items in a few seconds. When he comes back he grows tired and falls asleep for two hours. If the player declines all offers, Tom only has to rest for two minutes before being able to search again.\n</p><p>Players can make Tom's naps shorter by using a green <a href=\"/wiki/booster-28721\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Booster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">booster</a>.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Discounts</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/43/Tom_Balloon.png/revision/latest?cb=20140624182158\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Tom offering a discount\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tom offering a discount\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"199\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Tom offering a discount</figcaption></figure><p>\nOccasionally Tom is seen holding a balloon with a percent sign written on it. While holding this balloon he offers a ten percent discount for the five- and ten-day fees.</p><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/22/Tom_Discount.png/revision/latest?cb=20180817062753\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tom Discount\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"97\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/22/Tom_Discount.png/revision/latest?cb=20180817062753\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tom Discount\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/22/Tom_Discount.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20180817062753\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"97\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATom_Discount.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Tom releases the balloon after 10 minutes or so, at which point he no longer offers the discount. However, as the balloon floats away, players can tap it to receive <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points or <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Standing at the very bottom of the screen, it might be hard to notice when Tom is ready for another job. You can solve this by sowing one field with indigo when you have accepted one of Tom's offers. Indigo takes two hours to get ready to be harvested; If the indigo is ready, so is Tom.</li>\n<li>When Tom is unlocked you can use him to buy <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">land-clearing supplies</a> as these are hard to find and you need the room at this point. Alternatively, you can send him to fetch the most expensive item you have unlocked in order to get coins more easily.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=User%20blog%3AMindoPod%2FBuy%20Low%20-%20Sell%20High.%20Using%20Tom%20for%20profit\" title=\"User blog:MindoPod/Buy Low - Sell High. Using Tom for profit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">this profit table</a> by <a href=\"/unavailable-source?title=User%20blog%3AMindoPod\" title=\"User blog:MindoPod\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MindoPod</a> for more examples.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Did you know?</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Items that Tom has bought get a special icon on their box.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a5/Tom_RoadsideShop.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150325232032\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Items bought by Tom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Items bought by Tom\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"115\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Items bought by Tom</figcaption></figure>\n<div></div>\n<ul><li>Tom's appearance was changed and extensive new animations were added in the June 17, 2015 update.</li></ul>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/04/Tom_Comparison.png/revision/latest?cb=20150617180808\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Old vs. New Comparison\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Old vs. New Comparison\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"246\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Old vs. New Comparison</figcaption></figure>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-characters-29468\" title=\"Category:Characters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Characters</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/alfred-4276\" title=\"Alfred\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Alfred\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/angus-7540\" title=\"Angus\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Angus\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/ernest-26082\" title=\"Ernest\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Ernest\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/greg-7538\" title=\"Greg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Greg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/maggie-29376\" title=\"Maggie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Maggie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/rose-26084\" title=\"Rose\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Rose\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/tom-2981\" title=\"Tom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tom\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/town-visitors-13241\" title=\"Town Visitors\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lady\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/visitors-7539\" title=\"Visitors\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mike\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-game-features-7440\" title=\"Category:Game Features\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Game Features</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n <div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat (516 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150712182459\" title=\"Boat (516 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Boat (516 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/catalogue-8567\" title=\"Catalogue (112 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4a/Catalogue_Front.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/38?cb=20140720172814\" title=\"Catalogue (112 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Catalogue (112 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/customization-29379\" title=\"Customization (2